title: H.264 (fragmented mp4) 128x72 — a sidx before the fragments
author: Amrit Rosell — procedural pattern dxvkit_plus_core::testpattern::tiles (carried over from Loombda-rs loombda_media::testpattern)
source: tests/fixtures/tiles_h264.mp4 (this folder; 24 frames, 30 fps) remuxed without re-encoding into a fragmented MP4 by the ffmpeg 9.0.2 binary used as a black-box tool only (`ffmpeg -i tiles_h264.mp4 -c copy -movflags +frag_keyframe+empty_moov+default_base_moof+global_sidx -frag_duration 100000`); no FFmpeg code is linked or bundled
